{
  "id": "1791392186966",
  "alias": "扫地机柜门状态机",
  "description": "合并原先三个 *_plus 自动化，用 mode: queued 串行化，避免它们同时抢柜门和 pause。\n\n危险区语义：配置的区域包含充电桩，是「不能关门」的危险区。\n所以停靠时 outside_danger_zone=off、in_danger_zone=on；出门后正好反过来。\n\n四个阶段：\nA 启动：集成的 garage_guard 在下发命令前就开门并等门全开，扫地机不会被关着的门挡住。按约定只管 HA 发起的命令；从 Roborock App 启动不归这里管。\nB 离开：outside_danger_zone 从 off 变 on（扫地机真的走出危险区）后，暂停 → 关门 → 恢复。\n   暂停只在清扫状态里做，并确认真的进入 paused 才关门；否则只告警不关门，因为「暂停没生效」意味着它可能还在往门口方向移动。\nC 返回：状态变成回基站/洗拖布，且扫地机确实不在基站上，才开门。\n   这个「不在基站」的守卫是必须的：2026-10-08 01:26 扫地机全程停在基站上装拖布，状态却跳了 docking，把门白白开了又关、关了又开共 5 次。\nD 停靠：清扫已完成、已回基站、危险区传感器确认它在区内，才关门。\n   两个守卫都不能省：\n   · task_active 单独不够。它的状态表把 charging / attaching_the_mop / detaching_the_mop / back_to_dock_washing_duster 都当作「无任务」，所以「清扫中途回基站」（洗拖布、充电，任务没完成）会让它变成 off。此时若关门，扫地机马上要出来继续扫，而阶段 C 不会重新开门 —— 它从 charging 直接变 cleaning，不会报 returning_home。所以另外要求设备自己的「上次清扫结束」时间戳是最近的。\n   · 危险区传感器必须确认它在区内。停靠时它就在危险区里，若读数是过时的 on（「已离开」），关下去就会夹住机器。传感器没确认时门保持开启并告警。\n\n任何等待超时都只告警、不强行动作：门与扫地机状态不一致时，扫地机可能在门洞里，没有安全的自动恢复方式。",
  "triggers": [
    {
      "trigger": "state",
      "entity_id": "binary_sensor.g20s_ultra_outside_danger_zone",
      "id": "leave",
      "to": "on",
      "from": "off"
    },
    {
      "trigger": "state",
      "entity_id": "sensor.g20s_ultra_status",
      "id": "return",
      "to": [
        "returning_home",
        "docking",
        "going_to_wash_the_mop"
      ],
      "for": {
        "seconds": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "trigger": "state",
      "entity_id": "binary_sensor.g20s_ultra_task_active",
      "id": "park_task",
      "to": "off"
    },
    {
      "trigger": "state",
      "entity_id": "vacuum.g20s_ultra",
      "id": "park_dock",
      "to": "docked"
    }
  ],
  "conditions": [],
  "actions": [
    {
      "choose": [
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "condition": "trigger",
              "id": [
                "leave"
              ]
            },
            {
              "condition": "state",
              "entity_id": "sensor.g20s_ultra_status",
              "state": [
                "cleaning",
                "segment_cleaning",
                "zoned_cleaning",
                "spot_cleaning"
              ]
            },
            {
              "condition": "not",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "condition": "state",
                  "entity_id": "vacuum.g20s_ultra",
                  "state": [
                    "docked",
                    "charging"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "condition": "numeric_state",
              "entity_id": "cover.vacuum_garage_door",
              "attribute": "current_position",
              "above": 5
            }
          ],
          "sequence": [
            {
              "action": "vacuum.pause",
              "target": {
                "entity_id": "vacuum.g20s_ultra"
              }
            },
            {
              "continue_on_timeout": true,
              "timeout": "00:00:20",
              "wait_template": "{{ is_state('vacuum.g20s_ultra', 'paused') }}"
            },
            {
              "if": [
                {
                  "condition": "template",
                  "value_template": "{{ not wait.completed }}"
                }
              ],
              "then": [
                {
                  "action": "script.alert_notify",
                  "data": {
                    "level": "warning",
                    "title": "柜门状态机：暂停失败",
                    "message": "扫地机已走出危险区，但暂停没有生效，柜门保持开启。它可能仍在移动，此时关门有夹机风险。vacuum={{ states('vacuum.g20s_ultra') }}，status={{ states('sensor.g20s_ultra_status') }}"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "stop": "离开阶段暂停失败"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "cover.close_cover",
              "target": {
                "entity_id": "cover.vacuum_garage_door"
              }
            },
            {
              "continue_on_timeout": true,
              "timeout": "00:01:00",
              "wait_template": "{{ (state_attr('cover.vacuum_garage_door', 'current_position') | float(100)) < 5 }}"
            },
            {
              "if": [
                {
                  "condition": "template",
                  "value_template": "{{ not wait.completed }}"
                }
              ],
              "then": [
                {
                  "action": "script.alert_notify",
                  "data": {
                    "level": "warning",
                    "title": "柜门状态机：关门失败",
                    "message": "扫地机已暂停、不再移动，但柜门未能在 60 秒内完全关闭。扫地机保持暂停，请手动处理。"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "stop": "离开阶段关门失败"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "action": "roborock_plus.resume_task",
              "target": {
                "entity_id": "vacuum.g20s_ultra"
              }
            },
            {
              "action": "script.alert_notify",
              "data": {
                "level": "info",
                "title": "扫地机已出门",
                "message": "扫地机已离开危险区，柜门已关闭，任务已恢复。"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "condition": "trigger",
              "id": [
                "return"
              ]
            },
            {
              "condition": "not",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "condition": "state",
                  "entity_id": "vacuum.g20s_ultra",
                  "state": [
                    "docked",
                    "charging"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "condition": "numeric_state",
              "entity_id": "cover.vacuum_garage_door",
              "attribute": "current_position",
              "below": 95
            }
          ],
          "sequence": [
            {
              "action": "cover.open_cover",
              "target": {
                "entity_id": "cover.vacuum_garage_door"
              }
            },
            {
              "continue_on_timeout": true,
              "timeout": "00:01:00",
              "wait_template": "{{ (state_attr('cover.vacuum_garage_door', 'current_position') | float(0)) >= 95 }}"
            },
            {
              "if": [
                {
                  "condition": "template",
                  "value_template": "{{ not wait.completed }}"
                }
              ],
              "then": [
                {
                  "action": "script.alert_notify",
                  "data": {
                    "level": "critical",
                    "title": "柜门打开失败",
                    "message": "扫地机正在回基站（{{ trigger.to_state.state }}），但柜门未能在 60 秒内完全打开，有撞门风险。"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "stop": "返回阶段开门失败"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "condition": "trigger",
              "id": [
                "park_task",
                "park_dock"
              ]
            },
            {
              "condition": "state",
              "entity_id": "binary_sensor.g20s_ultra_task_active",
              "state": "off"
            },
            {
              "condition": "state",
              "entity_id": "vacuum.g20s_ultra",
              "state": [
                "docked",
                "charging"
              ]
            },
            {
              "condition": "numeric_state",
              "entity_id": "cover.vacuum_garage_door",
              "attribute": "current_position",
              "above": 5
            },
            {
              "condition": "template",
              "value_template": "{% set ended = states('sensor.sao_di_ji_v2_timestamp_2') %}{% if ended in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none', ''] %}false{% else %}{{ (as_timestamp(ended) | float(0)) > 0 and (as_timestamp(now()) - as_timestamp(ended)) < 600 }}{% endif %}"
            }
          ],
          "sequence": [
            {
              "delay": "00:00:08"
            },
            {
              "condition": "state",
              "entity_id": "binary_sensor.g20s_ultra_task_active",
              "state": "off"
            },
            {
              "condition": "state",
              "entity_id": "vacuum.g20s_ultra",
              "state": [
                "docked",
                "charging"
              ]
            },
            {
              "condition": "numeric_state",
              "entity_id": "cover.vacuum_garage_door",
              "attribute": "current_position",
              "above": 5
            },
            {
              "condition": "template",
              "value_template": "{% set ended = states('sensor.sao_di_ji_v2_timestamp_2') %}{% if ended in ['unknown', 'unavailable', 'none', ''] %}false{% else %}{{ (as_timestamp(ended) | float(0)) > 0 and (as_timestamp(now()) - as_timestamp(ended)) < 600 }}{% endif %}"
            },
            {
              "if": [
                {
                  "condition": "state",
                  "entity_id": "binary_sensor.g20s_ultra_outside_danger_zone",
                  "state": "off"
                }
              ],
              "then": [
                {
                  "action": "cover.close_cover",
                  "target": {
                    "entity_id": "cover.vacuum_garage_door"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "continue_on_timeout": true,
                  "timeout": "00:01:00",
                  "wait_template": "{{ (state_attr('cover.vacuum_garage_door', 'current_position') | float(100)) < 5 }}"
                },
                {
                  "if": [
                    {
                      "condition": "template",
                      "value_template": "{{ not wait.completed }}"
                    }
                  ],
                  "then": [
                    {
                      "action": "script.alert_notify",
                      "data": {
                        "level": "warning",
                        "title": "柜门状态机关门失败",
                        "message": "清扫任务已结束、扫地机已在基站，但柜门未能完全关闭，柜门保持开启。"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "action": "script.alert_notify",
                  "data": {
                    "level": "info",
                    "title": "扫地机已回柜",
                    "message": "任务已结束、扫地机已在基站，柜门已关闭。"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "else": [
                {
                  "action": "script.alert_notify",
                  "data": {
                    "level": "warning",
                    "title": "柜门状态机：未确认扫地机在危险区内，柜门保持开启",
                    "message": "扫地机已停靠在基站、任务已结束，但 outside_danger_zone={{ states('binary_sensor.g20s_ultra_outside_danger_zone') }}（停靠时应为 off）。危险区读数未确认它在区内，为避免夹机，柜门保持开启，请手动确认后关闭。"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "mode": "queued",
  "max": 5,
  "max_exceeded": "silent"
}